养智能体(让它懂你)\n喂知识(知识库):上传 PDF/Word/ 笔记 / 行业资料，建立专属记忆\n喂规则(提示词):用清晰指令定义行为(如:只回答 XX、用 123、不编造)\n喂案例:给示例，让它模仿格式与风格\n喂修正:答错就纠正，它会持续学习\n4. 赋予能力(工具 / 技能)\n联网搜索、代码解释、数据计算、文档总结、日程管理\n接入 API:如天气、地图、CRM、数据库\n5. 测试与迭代(越用越聪明)\n高频测试:每天 5 分钟，测 3–5 个问题\n反馈闭环:答错→改提示词 / 补知识库→再测\n灰度发布:先小范围用，再全量开放\n二、主流平台实操步骤(零代码)\n1. 豆包(字节)\n打开豆包 → 底部「智能体」→「创建智能体」\n填名称、简介、头像(简介写清:擅长什么、能解决什么问题)\n配置角色指令(人设 + 规则)\n上传知识库(文档 / 链接)\n开启工具(联网、文件解析等)\n保存 → 测试 → 迭代优化\n2. Coze(扣子，字节)\n注册 Coze → 新建 Bot\n「人设」写角色与规则\n「知识库」上传文档\n「工作流」拖拽节点:意图识别→知识检索→LLM 生成→输出\n配置提示词与工具\n试运行 → 发布(可发至飞书 / 微信)\n3. 腾讯元器\n进入元器 → 「创建智能体」\n填名称、描述、头像\n「角色设定」:核心工作、能力限制、性格语言\n「知识库」上传资料\n「技能」添加工具\n测试 → 发布\n4. 讯飞星火\n星火平台 →「智能体」→「创建」\n支持一句话创建(自动生成人设)\n「智能体指令」细化角色与任务\n上传知识库\n配置工具 / 工作流\n测试发布\n5. Kimi / DeepSeek / 通义千问\n通用入口:设置 → 自定义助手 / 我的智能体\n流程:起名 → 写人设 → 上传知识库 → 配置规则 → 保存使用\n三、进阶训练:让智能体更专业\n1. 提示词工程(核心)\n结构:角色 + 任务 + 格式 + 约束 + 示例\n示例:\n你是资深产品经理，帮我写 PRD。\n要求:结构清晰、用 123、不超过 500 字、只讲功能、不讲技术。\n参考格式:\n需求背景\n核心功能\n验收标准\n2. 知识库构建(RAG)\n上传:产品手册、行业报告、历史对话、个人笔记\n格式:PDF、Word、TXT、Markdown\n效果:回答基于你的资料，减少幻觉\n3. 工具集成(手脚)\n零代码平台:直接勾选「联网搜索」「代码解释」「文件解析」\n复杂场景:接入 MCP 服务、API、数据库\n4. 模型微调(专业场景)\n适用:垂直领域(法律、医疗、金融)\n数据:高质量场景数据(1000 条起)\n平台:OpenAI Fine-tuning、阿里云百炼、腾讯混元微调\n四、避坑指南\n❌ 不要贪多:一个智能体只做一件事\n❌ 不要模糊:人设与规则越具体越好\n❌ 不要只建不训:持续反馈 + 迭代才会聪明\n✅ 先做最小可用版，再逐步加功能\n五、快速上手建议\n新手首选:豆包 / Coze(零代码、中文友好、易上手)\n第一步:先做一个简单智能体(如:周报助手、文档问答)\n核心动作:定人设 + 喂知识库 + 写规则 + 反复测试\n\n\n--------\n搜索关键词：豆包AI智能体开发\n\n网页标题：豆包ai怎么创建智能体_豆包ai自定义角色设置【角色】-人工智能-PHP中文网\n\n网页链接：https://m.php.cn/faq/2127652.html\n\n发布时间：2026-02-21T00:00:00+08:00\n\n网页内容：豆包ai怎么创建智能体_豆包ai自定义角色设置【角色】\n冰火之心\n2026-02-21\n需通过豆包ai“智能体工坊”结构化创建：一、开通权限（app v7.5.0+或官网登录，实名认证）；二、点击“+创建智能体”初始化草稿；三、设定名称、简介、性格语气；四、添加常用或高级技能（含知识库接入）；五、保存并发布。\n\n![](https://img.php.cn/upload/article/001/431/639/177166387033951.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,p_40)\n如果您希望在豆包AI中构建一个具备独立身份、行为逻辑与专业能力的对话角色，则需通过“智能体工坊”完成结构化创建。以下是实现该目标的具体步骤：\n一、进入智能体工坊并开通权限\n智能体工坊是豆包AI专用于构建个性化AI角色的功能模块，必须在权限开通后方可使用。该模块对客户端版本和认证状态有明确要求，未满足条件将无法加载创建入口。\n1、启动豆包AI官方App，确认版本号为v7.5.0及以上 ；或直接访问官网doubao.com登录账号。\n2、点击底部导航栏的“我的”，向下滑动页面，找到并点击“智能体工坊”功能入口。\n3、若为首次使用，系统将弹出权限开通提示，点击“立即开通”，随后按指引完成实名认证流程。\n二、点击创建按钮初始化智能体模板\n“创建智能体”是唯一启动配置的入口动作，触发后将生成一个空白草稿态智能体，所有后续设定均基于此模板展开，不可跳过该初始化步骤。\n1、在智能体工坊首页，点击页面中央醒目的“+ 创建智能体”圆形按钮 。\n2、系统弹出确认框，显示“将新建一个未命名智能体”，点击“确定”以确认创建。\n3、页面自动跳转至编辑页，顶部显示“未命名智能体(草稿)”，此时可开始进行人设与技能配置。\n三、设定基础人设信息\n人设是智能体响应风格与表达逻辑的根本依据，包括名称、简介、性格特征及对话语气等维度，直接影响其拟人化程度与行为一致性。\n1、在“基本信息”区域，输入智能体名称，字符数限12字以内且不可含特殊符号 。\n2、在“角色简介”文本框中，用一句话描述其身份与核心定位 ，例如：“专注职场效率提升的资深HR顾问，语言简洁务实，善用结构化建议”。\n3、在“性格与语气”下拉菜单中，选择三项关键词，如“理性、耐心、条理清晰”，系统据此动态调整语序与词汇倾向。\n四、配置专属技能能力\n技能模块决定智能体可执行的具体任务类型，支持从预置库勾选通用能力，也可接入外部知识源以扩展专业深度。\n1、点击编辑页中的“添加技能”按钮，展开分类面板。\n2、在“常用技能”中至少勾选一项，例如“会议纪要生成”或“简历优化建议”。\n3、如需增强领域专业性，点击“高级技能”→“接入知识库”，上传PDF/Word格式文档（单文件≤50MB），系统将自动解析并建立语义索引。\n五、保存并发布智能体\n保存操作将草稿转为可用状态，发布后该智能体即出现在“我的智能体”列表中，可随时调用或继续编辑。\n1、点击编辑页右上角的“保存”按钮，确认无误后进入发布流程。\n2、在发布确认页，可选择是否公开可见，或仅限本人使用。\n3、点击“发布”，智能体即刻上线，可在首页或“我的”页面中快速访问。\n相关标签: ai 豆包 豆包ai Agent智能体\n\n\n========\n搜索关键词：doubao bot create\n\n网页标题：豆包AI智能体是什么怎么用 豆包AI创建和使用自定义智能体教程-人工智能-PHP中文网\n\n网页链接：https://m.php.cn/faq/1854152.html\n\n发布时间：2025-12-16T00:00:00+08:00\n\n网页内容：豆包AI智能体是什么怎么用 豆包AI创建和使用自定义智能体教程\nP粉602998670\n2025-12-16\n需创建豆包ai智能体以获得专属功能、身份与风格，操作包括：一、注册登录并进入创建入口；二、设定名称、头像与描述；三、配置角色定位与对话风格；四、注入知识库并设响应限制；五、测试后发布；六、通过app或网页调用。\n\n![](https://img.php.cn/upload/article/000/000/081/695e2132dbcec643.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,p_40)\n如果您希望在豆包平台中拥有一个具备特定功能、专属身份和稳定风格的AI助手，则需要创建并使用豆包AI智能体。该智能体并非预设通用模型，而是由用户自主定义角色、知识边界与交互方式的个性化AI实体。以下是具体操作步骤：\n一、注册登录并进入创建入口\n创建智能体的前提是拥有有效豆包账号。未注册用户需先完成手机号验证及基础资料填写；已注册用户直接登录即可。登录后，界面底部导航栏或首页显眼位置会显示“创作”或“创建AI智能体”按钮，点击即进入配置流程。\n1、打开豆包应用或访问 doubao.com 网页版；\n2、完成账号登录，确保处于个人主页状态；\n3、在首页中部或右下角找到“创作”按钮，点击后选择“创建AI智能体”选项。\n二、设定智能体基础属性\n此阶段用于确立智能体的视觉标识与基本身份认知，包括名称、头像与简短描述，构成其对外呈现的第一印象。名称需简洁且体现用途，头像应具辨识度，描述则需明确其核心能力范围与语言风格倾向。\n1、在名称输入框中填写如“法律条款解读助手”等职能导向型名称；\n2、点击头像区域，从相册选取图片或使用AI自动生成头像；\n3、在描述栏中输入不超过200字的功能说明，例如：“专注解析《民法典》条文，用通俗语言说明适用场景与常见误区，不提供司法建议。”\n三、配置角色与对话风格\n角色设定决定智能体在交互中如何理解用户意图并组织回应逻辑，而对话风格则影响语气、句式长度与专业程度。二者共同构成智能体的行为一致性基础，避免回答出现风格断裂或角色模糊。\n1、在“角色定位”模块中选择或手动输入角色类型，如“医疗健康顾问”“编程教学助手”“古诗文翻译专家” ；\n2、在“对话风格”选项中勾选偏好项，例如“简洁专业”“亲切口语化”“严谨学术风” ；\n3、可额外补充“禁止行为”提示，如“不生成代码执行结果”“不虚构法律判例”“不推测未明示病情”。\n四、注入知识与限制条件\n为提升回答准确性与领域适配性，可通过上传文档、粘贴文本或结构化输入方式向智能体注入专属知识。同时设置响应边界，防止其越界作答或调用未经确认的信息源。\n1、点击“添加知识库”，支持上传PDF、TXT、DOCX格式文件，单次上限20MB；\n2、在文本输入区直接粘贴政策原文、课程大纲、产品说明书等关键内容；\n3、在“响应限制”中启用“仅依据所给资料回答”开关，并设定超纲问题统一回复话术，如“该问题超出当前知识范围，建议查阅XX官网最新公告。”\n五、测试与发布智能体\n发布前必须进行多轮问答验证，覆盖典型提问、边界提问与干扰提问三类场景，确认其响应稳定性、逻辑连贯性与风格一致性。测试通过后方可公开或设为私有使用。\n1、在创建页面底部点击“开始测试”，进入模拟对话窗口；\n2、依次输入预设测试问题，例如：“劳动合同试用期最长几个月？”“如果公司未缴社保，员工能否主张赔偿？”“请用小学生能听懂的话解释‘无固定期限劳动合同’”；\n3、观察每条回答是否符合角色设定、引用知识准确、未出现幻觉信息；\n4、确认无误后点击“发布智能体”，选择公开可见或仅自己可用。\n六、日常使用与调用方式\n发布后的智能体将出现在个人中心“我的智能体”列表中，支持多种交互路径调用。不同终端（App/网页）在语音、消息流、快捷指令等方面存在功能差异，需按实际界面操作。\n1、在豆包App中点击底部“对话”页，顶部搜索栏输入智能体名称，点击进入专属聊天窗口；\n2、网页版用户可在左侧边栏找到“我的智能体”分类，点击目标智能体图标即可发起对话；\n3、支持语音输入：点击输入框旁麦克风图标，说出问题后自动转文字并发送；\n4、已启用电话功能的手机端用户，可在智能体详情页点击“拨打电话”按钮，实现全双工实时语音交互。\n\n\n--------\n搜索关键词：doubao bot create\n\n网页标题：doubao\n\n网页链接：https://www.toolmage.com/en/tool/doubao/\n\n发布时间：2025-08-11T00:00:00+08:00\n\n网页内容：![](https://www.toolmage.com/media/tools/logos/doubao_logo_iqfqxpkj.jpg)\n doubao\nDoubao is a powerful AI smart assistant developed by ByteDance. It excels at conversation, content creation, coding, and more. With a user-friendly interface and multi-modal capabilities (text, voice, image), it serves as a versatile tool for productivity, learning, and daily tasks, available for free on both web and mobile platforms.\n5\n2025-08-11\nPrice Type Freemium | Monthly Traffic: 68.2M\n![](https://www.toolmage.com/media/tools/previews/doubao_page_ykekc4qb.jpg)\ndoubao Overview\nDoubao, which translates to \"Bean Bun,\" is the flagship AI smart assistant developed by ByteDance, the tech giant behind TikTok. Launched as a comprehensive and accessible AI tool, Doubao is built upon advanced large language models, designed to assist users with a vast array of tasks through natural and intuitive conversations. It aims to integrate powerful AI capabilities into the daily workflows and creative processes of millions, positioning itself as a direct competitor to other major AI chatbots.\nAvailable on both web and mobile applications, Doubao offers a seamless, cross-platform experience. Its interface is clean and straightforward, encouraging users to interact with the AI without a steep learning curve. The platform is not just a simple question-and-answer machine; it's a multifaceted assistant capable of understanding context, generating diverse forms of content, and even processing multi-modal inputs like images and voice commands.\nHow to use doubao\nGetting started with Doubao is simple and intuitive. Follow these steps to begin leveraging its capabilities:\nAccess the Platform: Navigate to the Doubao website (doubao.com) or download the official Doubao app from your mobile app store.\nSign Up/Log In: Create an account or log in. This typically requires a phone number, which is a standard practice for major applications from ByteDance.\nStart a Conversation: In the main chat interface, type your question, prompt, or command into the text box at the bottom of the screen and press enter.\nUse Multi-modal Features: Look for icons to upload an image for analysis or questions, or use the microphone icon to input your query via voice.\nExplore Intelligent Agents: Doubao features a library of specialized 'Intelligent Agents' (智能体). These are pre-configured bots designed for specific tasks like creative writing, marketing copywriting, code generation, or travel planning. Select one to start a focused conversation.\nManage Chats: Your conversations are saved in a history panel, allowing you to revisit, continue, or delete them. You can start new, separate chats for different topics to keep your interactions organized.\nCore Features of doubao\nAdvanced Conversational AI: Engages in fluid, context-aware, and human-like conversations on a wide range of topics.\nMulti-modal Capabilities: Accepts text, voice, and image inputs, allowing users to ask questions about pictures or interact hands-free.\nVersatile Content Creation: Generates high-quality written content, including articles, essays, emails, social media posts, poetry, and ad copy.\nPowerful Coding Assistant: Writes code snippets, debugs existing code, explains complex algorithms, and translates code between different programming languages.\nKnowledge \u0026 Q\u0026A: Provides detailed and accurate answers to complex questions by drawing from its extensive training data.\nText Summarization and Analysis: Quickly condenses long articles, reports, or documents into key points and summaries.\nTranslation Services: Offers reliable translation between Chinese, English, and other major languages.\nSpecialized Intelligent Agents (智能体): A growing library of expert AI personas tailored for specific professions and tasks, enhancing productivity in niche areas.\nUse Cases for doubao\nDoubao's versatility makes it valuable for a diverse user base:\nStudents: Can use it for homework assistance, explaining difficult concepts, outlining essays, and conducting research for projects.\nDevelopers and Programmers: A valuable tool for generating boilerplate code, debugging, learning new programming frameworks, and optimizing algorithms.\nMarketers and Content Creators: Ideal for brainstorming campaign ideas, writing compelling ad copy, generating blog post drafts, and creating engaging social media content.\nBusiness Professionals: Can streamline daily tasks like drafting professional emails, summarizing meeting transcripts, and creating presentation outlines.\nEveryday Users: A helpful companion for planning trips, finding recipes, translating languages, getting recommendations, or satisfying general curiosity.\nAdvantages of doubao\nDoubao stands out in the competitive AI landscape due to several key advantages:\nBacked by ByteDance: Developed and supported by a global tech leader, ensuring continuous innovation and access to state-of-the-art AI models.\nGenerous Free Access: The core functionalities are offered for free, making powerful AI accessible to a broad audience without an initial financial barrier.\nUser-Centric Design: Features a clean, intuitive, and responsive interface on both web and mobile, prioritizing a smooth user experience.\nHigh Performance: Optimized for fast response times, providing quick and relevant answers to user queries.\nCross-Platform Availability: Seamlessly switch between your computer and mobile device, with your chat history synced across platforms.\nPricing and Plans\nDoubao operates on a freemium model:\nFree Tier: Most users can access the core features of Doubao, including standard chat, content creation, and use of many Intelligent Agents, completely free of charge. This tier is designed to be highly capable for everyday tasks.\nDoubao Pro: For users requiring more power and advanced capabilities, a paid subscription plan, \"Doubao Pro,\" is available. This plan typically offers access to more advanced language models, a significantly larger context window for processing longer documents, faster response times, and exclusive features. The specific pricing is available on the official website and app.\ndoubaoWebsite Traffic Analysis\nLatest Traffic\nMonthly Visits\n68.2M\nAverage Visit Duration\n4:47\nPages per Visit\n3.80\nBounce Rate\n26.8%\nStatus\nUp +12.5% vs Last Month\nData updated on 2026-03-17\nMonthly Traffic Trend\n100.0M\n20.0M\n0\nGeography\nTop 5 Countries/Regions\n🇨🇳 China\n95.32%\n🇭🇰 Hong Kong\n2.77%\n🇺🇸 United States\n0.91%\n🇹🇼 Taiwan\n0.77%\n🇸🇬 Singapore\n0.23%\nTraffic source\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth\u003eSource Type\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003ePercentage\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eDirect Access\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e78.88%\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eNatural Search\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e17.90%\u003c/td\u003e\u0